Changelog: 26-10-2026 22:37:18

Added. portable: the portable window of the Windows Portable Suite (owner, 26-10-2026: direction D, B's amber on C's
cards). PORTABLE is its design as a theme for core's widgets; PortableHeader, Card, Pill, Legend and PortableWindow
are what its apps are built of. Sizes are the mock-up's at 1280 x 720 and scale with the screen. The focused card
is raised with an amber edge and glow; a focused pill is dimmed. The d-pad, the left stick or the arrow keys move the
